WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.150 --> 00:00:00.983
- All right, y'all.

00:00:00.983 --> 00:00:03.420
When I see something insanely
adorable on social media,

00:00:03.420 --> 00:00:05.070
I know exactly who to share it with.

00:00:05.070 --> 00:00:05.903
All of you.

00:00:05.903 --> 00:00:06.736
This is what I'm liking.

00:00:06.736 --> 00:00:09.750
(upbeat energetic music)

00:00:09.750 --> 00:00:13.200
A lot of kids will ask their
moms and dads for a dog,

00:00:13.200 --> 00:00:14.940
maybe a cat or a fish.

00:00:14.940 --> 00:00:17.220
Well, one first grader has
something else in mind.

00:00:17.220 --> 00:00:19.192
Madeline wants a unicorn, y'all.

00:00:19.192 --> 00:00:20.220
(crowd exults)
It's incredible.

00:00:20.220 --> 00:00:22.560
And just to be sure she
could keep one at home,

00:00:22.560 --> 00:00:23.393
she wrote a letter

00:00:23.393 --> 00:00:26.670
to the local animal control
asking for permission.

00:00:26.670 --> 00:00:28.860
Lo and behold, she got official approval

00:00:28.860 --> 00:00:30.721
from the county with a few caveats.

00:00:30.721 --> 00:00:32.700
(Kelly chuckles)
Here are just a couple.

00:00:32.700 --> 00:00:34.890
The unicorn is given regular access

00:00:34.890 --> 00:00:37.861
to sunlight, moonbeams, and rainbows.

00:00:37.861 --> 00:00:38.790
(crowd laughs)
Amazing.

00:00:38.790 --> 00:00:42.180
Next, any sparkles or glitter used

00:00:42.180 --> 00:00:45.330
on the unicorn must be
non-toxic and biodegradable

00:00:45.330 --> 00:00:47.340
to ensure the unicorn's good health.

00:00:47.340 --> 00:00:48.600
I love animal control.

00:00:48.600 --> 00:00:50.760
Right now, we have Madeline
on the line right now

00:00:50.760 --> 00:00:52.860
along with her momma, Leilani

00:00:52.860 --> 00:00:54.930
and the LA County
Department of Animal Control

00:00:54.930 --> 00:00:57.090
and Control Director, Marcia.

00:00:57.090 --> 00:00:59.311
Y'all give it up.
(crowd claps)

00:00:59.311 --> 00:01:00.144
- Hi!
- Hi!

00:01:01.380 --> 00:01:02.790
- Oh my gosh!

00:01:02.790 --> 00:01:04.200
Well, Leilani and Madeline,

00:01:04.200 --> 00:01:06.330
how did the idea of a
pet unicorn come about?

00:01:06.330 --> 00:01:07.590
This is incredible.

00:01:07.590 --> 00:01:11.580
- Well, I've always wanted a
pet unicorn since I was three

00:01:11.580 --> 00:01:16.020
because they're so magical and
they can grant magic wishes.

00:01:16.020 --> 00:01:19.380
They can also produce their
own glitter and sparkles.

00:01:19.380 --> 00:01:22.530
So, when me and my mom
were talking about pets,

00:01:22.530 --> 00:01:25.110
I said, I wanted a pet unicorn.

00:01:25.110 --> 00:01:26.467
So she said,

00:01:26.467 --> 00:01:28.530
"Well, you're going to need some type

00:01:28.530 --> 00:01:31.110
of permission for such a large animal."

00:01:31.110 --> 00:01:31.943
- Exactly.

00:01:31.943 --> 00:01:33.450
And Madeline said, "Okay."

00:01:33.450 --> 00:01:36.060
And just walked on
upstairs, 20 minutes later.

00:01:36.060 --> 00:01:37.770
She had gone into my stationary box,

00:01:37.770 --> 00:01:40.020
wrote her own letter and came back down

00:01:40.020 --> 00:01:43.170
and handed it to me and
asked me to mail it for her.

00:01:43.170 --> 00:01:46.530
We never expected to hear
a response from LA County.

00:01:46.530 --> 00:01:49.350
And when Marcia called, we
decided to keep it a secret

00:01:49.350 --> 00:01:51.180
and surprise her on her birthday.

00:01:51.180 --> 00:01:52.380
So on her seventh birthday,

00:01:52.380 --> 00:01:55.080
we went to tour the animal care center

00:01:55.080 --> 00:01:57.870
and we were able to see all
of the animals in the facility

00:01:57.870 --> 00:02:02.160
and she was given permission
and granted the license

00:02:02.160 --> 00:02:04.530
and the stuffed unicorn right here.

00:02:04.530 --> 00:02:06.930
And we're just so incredibly
grateful and thankful

00:02:06.930 --> 00:02:09.570
to LA County and Marcia and the team

00:02:09.570 --> 00:02:13.230
and we were just really
appreciated their enthusiasm

00:02:13.230 --> 00:02:14.850
and their creativity and thoughtfulness.

00:02:14.850 --> 00:02:17.520
It's been such a special
moment for all of us.

00:02:17.520 --> 00:02:19.560
- It's incredible.
(crowd claps)

00:02:19.560 --> 00:02:23.580
Marcia, what did you think
when you got the letter?

00:02:23.580 --> 00:02:25.230
- Well, we were really surprised,

00:02:25.230 --> 00:02:27.330
but thought it was a wonderful request

00:02:27.330 --> 00:02:29.580
and Madeline had put a
lot of thought into it.

00:02:29.580 --> 00:02:32.490
We had never approved a
unicorn license before

00:02:32.490 --> 00:02:33.990
but they're not a dangerous animal.

00:02:33.990 --> 00:02:36.450
So, we didn't see any
reason why we couldn't.

00:02:36.450 --> 00:02:40.680
And we set forth some requirements
for her to have a unicorn

00:02:40.680 --> 00:02:43.426
and the word got out and
it was such a popular idea

00:02:43.426 --> 00:02:46.650
that we got a lot of requests
from people around the country

00:02:46.650 --> 00:02:49.110
to have unicorn licenses as well.

00:02:49.110 --> 00:02:53.580
So now our foundation is
selling them for $25 donation

00:02:53.580 --> 00:02:54.870
which will help the animals.

00:02:54.870 --> 00:02:58.440
A person will get a
pre-approved unicorn license

00:02:58.440 --> 00:03:00.627
and a tag and a stuffed unicorn animal.

00:03:00.627 --> 00:03:03.360
(crowd claps)
- Aw, I love this.

00:03:03.360 --> 00:03:07.380
So Madeline, you have a plan
to find your unicorn, right?

00:03:07.380 --> 00:03:09.210
Y'all are traveling somewhere, right?

00:03:09.210 --> 00:03:10.043
- Yes.

00:03:10.043 --> 00:03:13.230
National Animal of Scotland is a unicorn.

00:03:13.230 --> 00:03:17.130
My family is planning to
go to Scotland in 2024.

00:03:17.130 --> 00:03:19.020
I'm going to start my search

00:03:19.020 --> 00:03:21.660
in the magical forest of Scotland

00:03:21.660 --> 00:03:23.784
because I heard the unicorns live there.

00:03:23.784 --> 00:03:26.313
(crowd exults)
- I love that!

00:03:27.210 --> 00:03:30.120
Well, thank you so much,
Madeline, Leilani and Marcia

00:03:30.120 --> 00:03:31.500
good luck with the unicorn, y'all.

00:03:31.500 --> 00:03:32.947
I'm liking your post right now.

00:03:32.947 --> 00:03:35.430
(crowd clapping)
(crowd cheering)

00:03:35.430 --> 00:03:36.263
And that's not all,

00:03:36.263 --> 00:03:38.640
our season long partner
pilot pin makers of friction

00:03:38.640 --> 00:03:41.130
to go to race bull pin of
"The Kelly Clarkson Show" want

00:03:41.130 --> 00:03:43.950
to celebrate the lovers
of unicorns and magic.

00:03:43.950 --> 00:03:45.360
So they're giving you a thousand dollars.

00:03:45.360 --> 00:03:46.380
So that's $500,
(crowd cheering)

00:03:46.380 --> 00:03:48.993
for magical unicorn fund

00:03:48.993 --> 00:03:51.543
and $500 to care for her unicorn.

00:03:52.950 --> 00:03:54.959
Y'all have a great 2023,

00:03:54.959 --> 00:03:56.880
thank you, all our guest this hour,

00:03:56.880 --> 00:04:00.510
Joel McHale, Danielle
Pinnock, Reginason Pastor

00:04:00.510 --> 00:04:02.190
and Linda Saddles and Corey Ward.

00:04:02.190 --> 00:04:03.918
Y'all have a great day and if it's not,

00:04:03.918 --> 00:04:05.252
(crowd cheering drowns out speaker)

